{"id":"b7caccb1060f0bd6","group":"91","path":"91/91-thm-fixed-point-non-uniqueness.md","title":"闭项真理陈述者产生不同一致固定点","display":"thm-fixed-point-non-uniqueness — 闭项真理陈述者产生不同一致固定点","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-thm-fixed-point-non-uniqueness","aliases":["91-thm-fixed-point-non-uniqueness"],"display":"thm-fixed-point-non-uniqueness — 闭项真理陈述者产生不同一致固定点","depends_on":["[[91-df-truth-teller-semantic]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-thm-fixed-point-non-uniqueness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-thm-fixed-point-non-uniqueness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-fixed-point-non-uniqueness — 闭项真理陈述者产生不同一致固定点"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8e63bca271dfc8f1\" href=\"?note=8e63bca271dfc8f1\" title=\"91-df-truth-teller-semantic\">91-df-truth-teller-semantic</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J\">\\(J\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau=T(t)\">\\(\\tau=T(t)\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J)\">\\(\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J)\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8e63bca271dfc8f1\" href=\"?note=8e63bca271dfc8f1\" title=\"91-df-truth-teller-semantic\">91-df-truth-teller-semantic</a> 的闭项和固定点约定。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point\\text{-}non\\text{-}uniqueness}\\vdash\\quad\n\\exists X_+,X_-\\in\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J)\\,\n[\\ulcorner\\tau\\urcorner\\in X_+\\land\\ulcorner\\neg\\tau\\urcorner\\in X_-\\land X_+\\ne X_-].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point\\text{-}non\\text{-}uniqueness}\\vdash\\quad\n\\exists X_+,X_-\\in\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J)\\,\n[\\ulcorner\\tau\\urcorner\\in X_+\\land\\ulcorner\\neg\\tau\\urcorner\\in X_-\\land X_+\\ne X_-].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>分别取真、假种子再作一致闭包，前两项成立。若二者相同，该集合将同时含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\tau\">\\(\\neg\\tau\\)</span> 的编码，违反一致性，故必不同。\n从单调性本身不能推出非唯一性；这里依赖具体真理陈述者的正自指循环。</p>\n<p>来源：Lemma 15.7，印刷页 191，PDF 页 202。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-truth-teller-semantic","status":"resolved","id":"8e63bca271dfc8f1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-truth-teller-semantic]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-truth-teller-semantic","status":"resolved","id":"8e63bca271dfc8f1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$J$、$\\tau=T(t)$ 及 $\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J)$ 使用 [[91-df-truth-teller-semantic]] 的闭项和固定点约定。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"J","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau=T(t)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point\\text{-}non\\text{-}uniqueness}\\vdash\\quad\n\\exists X_+,X_-\\in\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J)\\,\n[\\ulcorner\\tau\\urcorner\\in X_+\\land\\ulcorner\\neg\\tau\\urcorner\\in X_-\\land X_+\\ne X_-].","display":true},{"tex":"\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg\\tau","display":false}],"bytes":1126,"backlinks":[{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-129","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-thm-fixed-point-non-uniqueness]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anc